# Minimal zic source for the two-version time zone database fixture.
#
# From tzdata 2019b, Brazil has no daylight saving time, so every local time in
# America/Sao_Paulo is UTC-3 all year.
#
# Regenerate from crates/opportune with:
#   zic -d tests/fixtures/tzdb-2019 tests/fixtures/brazil-2019b.zi
Zone	America/Sao_Paulo	-3:00	-	-03
